WEBVTT

00:00:00.478 --> 00:00:04.760
Open the review queue and find the submitted fictional test.

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:11.707
Office staff review the result, readings, service records, tester credentials, and form.

00:00:11.707 --> 00:00:16.997
Return a record for correction when required information is wrong or incomplete.

00:00:30.783 --> 00:00:35.104
Open the test and inspect the stored readings and performed date.

00:00:35.104 --> 00:00:38.814
Confirm the selected form and licensed tester.

00:00:38.814 --> 00:00:45.011
Approval should follow your office review policy and the applicable municipality requirements.

00:01:01.081 --> 00:01:06.573
Approve and generate PDF stores the approval and an immutable report revision.

00:01:06.573 --> 00:01:11.455
This makes the approved document available for review and later submission.

00:01:11.455 --> 00:01:17.060
Approval itself does not mean the municipality has received or accepted the report.

00:01:31.432 --> 00:01:36.543
Open the exact approved PDF and inspect the fictional training report.

00:01:36.543 --> 00:01:42.187
The same approved revision is the one attached when preparing the municipality submission.
